# VUE + INERTIA PATTERNS

## Component Structure

- All page components in `resources/js/Pages/`
- Reusable components in `resources/js/Components/`
- Layouts in `resources/js/Layouts/`
- Use Composition API with `<script setup>`

## Inertia Routing

```php
// Backend (routes/web.php or controller)
return Inertia::render('Users/Index', [
    'users' => User::all(),
]);
```

```vue
<!-- Frontend (resources/js/Pages/Users/Index.vue) -->
<script setup>
defineProps({ users: Array });
</script>
```

## Navigation

Use Inertia `<Link>` — not plain `<a href>` for internal routes.

## Forms

Use `useForm` from `@inertiajs/vue3` for submissions to Laravel routes.

## Access Shared Data

```vue
<template>
    <div v-if="$page.props.flash.message">
        {{ $page.props.flash.message }}
    </div>
</template>
```
